fba51f\"> (+50% Total Physical Attack)</span> <span style=\"color:#fb1f1f\">Physical Damage</span> and slowing enemies by 30% for 0.5s. This skill has no base cooldown but consumes 2 <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Sacred Orbs</span> per cast.\nThis skill deals 50% damage to Creeps."}, {"name": "Valkyrie Descent", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage_2_1_18_2/100_49a8b4de271d0162ab9e26e06819840e.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 72, "tagname": "Morph", "tagrgb": "97,127,198"}, {"tagid": 62, "tagname": "Buff", "tagrgb": "79,156,184"}], "cdcost": "CD: 34", "desc": "Freya selects a target area and dives down as a Sacred Orb (gaining Control Immunity and 50% Damage Reduction), dealing 300<span style=\"color:#fba51f\"> (+75% Total Physical Attack)</span> <span style=\"color:#fb1f1f\">Physical Damage</span> and 40% slow to enemies in her path and at the landing point for 2s.\n\nUpon landing, Freya enters the <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Valkyrie</span> state for 12s, during which her Basic Attacks deal 30 extra damage (extra damage cannot Crit) and she recovers 40<span style=\"color:#fba51f\"> (+40% Total Physical Attack)</span> HP per Basic Attack, and her Basic Attacks deal splash damage."}], "fullbuilds": [{"items": [{"name": "Golden Staff", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_98d1154b4f017c7b68a4071e3c5e9364.png"}, {"name": "Tough Boots", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_e7045efd7cf5bcb488594a7eac3ab4e2.png"}, {"name": "War Axe", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage_2_1_60_2/100_fa1f5745cf88227722a9ff22c95c0bc4.png"}, {"name": "Corrosion Scythe", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_486be2a89fc7fba69cd82c71d80395af.png"}, {"name": "Endless Battle", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_94d8c6e27b6f01274bec5156474f4d2c.png"}, {"name": "Rose Gold Meteor", "icon": "ht